    {
      "id": "mjP3WH9z5tlhDkOv6pNfI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1910.3333740234375,
      "y": 524.5,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aA",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2122124323,
      "version": 314,
      "versionNonce": 904575746,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792943164800,
      "created": 1792838666286,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "因为扩容操作非常耗时，如果能够确定字典的容量且不会频繁变动，在new的时候直接带容\n量声明，可以减少扩容开销",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "因为扩容操作非常耗时，如果能够确定字典的容量且不会频繁变动，在new的时候直接带容量声明，可以减少扩容开销",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "4KREbOUWllmiKJ4oIKPKC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 795.3333740234375,
      "y": 1055.5000305175781,
      "width": 294.80389404296875,
      "height": 57,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1543080158,
      "version": 134,
      "versionNonce": 1052275522,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792917076611,
      "created": 1792911177295,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "int[] buckets",
      "fontSize": 45.6,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "int[] buckets",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "yj1MI34-KE5Q0nsUKTIPa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 810.3333129882812,
      "y": 1198.5000610351562,
      "width": 352.43757112758453,
      "height": 58.983397737184134,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1626120670,
      "version": 349,
      "versionNonce": 1600061214,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792917078297,
      "created": 1792911775773,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Entry[] entries",
      "fontSize": 47.18671818974733,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Entry[] entries",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5P0NJkF6ZIhWW3taRdQ1T",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1371.9999805092812,
      "y": 994.5,
      "width": 650.7398071289062,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1211982110,
      "version": 1949,
      "versionNonce": 943020610,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792920180368,
      "created": 1792913019101,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "查询流程：\n① h = TKey.GetHashCode()\n② i = h % buckets.Length\n③ v = buckets[i]\n    若 v == 0：无数据，查询结束\n    若 v > 0，j = v - 1\n    （v < 0 的情况不存在）\n④ e = entries[j]\n    若 e.hashCode == h && e.key == TKey，查询到结果，返回 e.value\n    否则 next = e.next\n⑤ 若 next == -1：冲突链表查到底，无数据，查询结束\n    若 next > -1，j = next，返回第 ④ 步\n    （next < -1 的情况不存在）",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "查询流程：\n① h = TKey.GetHashCode()\n② i = h % buckets.Length\n③ v = buckets[i]\n    若 v == 0：无数据，查询结束\n    若 v > 0，j = v - 1\n    （v < 0 的情况不存在）\n④ e = entries[j]\n    若 e.hashCode == h && e.key == TKey，查询到结果，返回 e.value\n    否则 next = e.next\n⑤ 若 next == -1：冲突链表查到底，无数据，查询结束\n    若 next > -1，j = next，返回第 ④ 步\n    （next < -1 的情况不存在）",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "JehRCuO54viNY1EbvwLWu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1404.3332629799843,
      "y": 1366.1665649414062,
      "width": 555.1598510742188,
      "height": 825,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aN",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 660758750,
      "version": 1310,
      "versionNonce": 489099870,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792921416217,
      "created": 1792919084978,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "添加流程：\n① h = TKey.GetHashCode()\n② i = h % buckets.length\n③ v = buckets[i]\n    若 v == 0：无数据，下一步\n    若 v > 0：桶里有数据，顺链表逐一查询\n                若查到匹配数据，直接抛重复健异常\n                若查到底没有匹配数据，下一步\n    （v < 0 的情况不存在）\n④ 找空位\n    若freeList > -1：有废弃空位可以复用\n                    index = freeList\n                    freeList = -entries[index].next\n                    freeCount--\n                    进入第 ⑦ 步\n    freeList == -1：没有废弃空位\n                    若 count == entries.Length，进入第 ⑤ 步\n                    否则进入第 ⑥ 步\n    （freeList < -1 的情况不存在）\n⑤ 扩容\n    扩容操作……\n    buckets 和 entries 长度变化后，重算 i 和 v\n    进入第 ⑦ 步\n⑥ 无需扩容\n    index = count\n    count++\n⑦ 写入数据\n    entries[index].hashCode = h\n    entries[index].key = TKey\n    entries[index].value = TValue\n    头插法挂载\n    entries[index].next = v - 1\n    buckets[i] = index + 1",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "添加流程：\n① h = TKey.GetHashCode()\n② i = h % buckets.length\n③ v = buckets[i]\n    若 v == 0：无数据，下一步\n    若 v > 0：桶里有数据，顺链表逐一查询\n                若查到匹配数据，直接抛重复健异常\n                若查到底没有匹配数据，下一步\n    （v < 0 的情况不存在）\n④ 找空位\n    若freeList > -1：有废弃空位可以复用\n                    index = freeList\n                    freeList = -entries[index].next\n                    freeCount--\n                    进入第 ⑦ 步\n    freeList == -1：没有废弃空位\n                    若 count == entries.Length，进入第 ⑤ 步\n                    否则进入第 ⑥ 步\n    （freeList < -1 的情况不存在）\n⑤ 扩容\n    扩容操作……\n    buckets 和 entries 长度变化后，重算 i 和 v\n    进入第 ⑦ 步\n⑥ 无需扩容\n    index = count\n    count++\n⑦ 写入数据\n    entries[index].hashCode = h\n    entries[index].key = TKey\n    entries[index].value = TValue\n    头插法挂载\n    entries[index].next = v - 1\n    buckets[i] = index + 1",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "quHHVHMgwu3JZfu-0U5Sb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1989.3333545327187,
      "y": 713.4999389648438,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
